{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:43 2026-09-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:43 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:43 2026-09-23 HKT</p><p>屯門有學生打架同被捕。今日（23日）早上11時08分，屯門旺賢街一所群育學校的兩名分別13歲和14歲的男學生，在校內因故爭執，繼而大打出手揮拳互毆。警方接獲校方報案到場，經調查後分別以涉嫌「襲擊致造成身體傷害」和「普通襲擊」拘捕兩名男學生，正調查事故原因。兩名男學生均受傷，由救護車送院治理。</p><img alt=\"校內兩名男學生打架同被捕。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50ada0a8c767b84667144bb989a867a7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_26_02_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dd9fb7d5ecf32d1c39c94d52d267236/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_26_02.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事學校位於旺賢街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42396992377a59a58b8ad7efac4d1b30/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_26_00.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2aea9226b13c5b1c7a6ff10fd7cf056/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_25_58.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebc58aa92f3b079fc17cb21de62483aa/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_25_57_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eea884652f4ff7c741e756bf0fc56f99/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_13_25_57.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T05:58:53.743271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}